      "text": "I think I need to go under it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5418,
      "text": "Is that helping?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5422,
      "text": "I'm stronger so both of you come up here"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5424,
      "text": "and I'm gonna push it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5426,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5428,
      "text": "Okay, hold on to it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5430,
      "text": "Okay, holding."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5432,
      "text": "Okay, I'm gonna push it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5439,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5766,
      "text": "Is that me?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5768,
      "text": "What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5774,
      "text": "I thought you were talking about Elizabeth again."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5788,
      "text": "We died by the car."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5790,
      "text": "By the stairs."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5792,
      "text": "Uh-oh."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5794,
      "text": "Mama, can you go to the other side and listen?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5796,
      "text": "Let's push the E."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5798,
      "text": "It's okay. You have us anyways."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5855,
      "text": "Turn around."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5857,
      "text": "Wait."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5859,
      "text": "Go around. Oh, wow."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5861,
      "text": "Wait, can we all try lifting this piano?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5863,
      "text": "I left some stuff"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5865,
      "text": "by another point."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5867,
      "text": "Can we all try to lift this piano?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5869,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5871,
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5879,
      "text": "Wait."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5883,
      "text": "There's a skull bomb."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5885,
      "text": "Did she die?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5888,
      "text": "Are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5890,
      "text": "Did she die?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 5892,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6182,
      "text": "She's behind the guy. He's looking the other way."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6184,
      "text": "Yeah, but you never know when he's just gonna be like,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6186,
      "text": "You're next."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6195,
      "text": "I'm coming this way."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6197,
      "text": "Piano?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6225,
      "text": "That's not fair."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6231,
      "text": "I recognize the skull."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6241,
      "text": "Is it too late now to say sorry?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6247,
      "text": "I'm about to pick up your body."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6251,
      "text": "You exploded too."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6606,
      "text": "Wait, we do have inventory?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6608,
      "text": "Yes, it's one, two, three, four."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6610,
      "text": "But only for equipment."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6612,
      "text": "I lied to you puppies, sorry."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6614,
      "text": "No, no."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6616,
      "text": "We don't have equipment."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6620,
      "text": "Get him."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6635,
      "text": "You gotta pet it, Laura."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6637,
      "text": "You have to kill it, you have to kill it, you have to kill it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6672,
      "text": "Kill it, kill it, Laura."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6674,
      "text": "Is it dead?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 6680,
      "text": "Sorry."
    }
